    "title": "Trump administration ends TPS for Venezuelans who registered in 2021 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Daniela Gonzalez ,\n5 hours ago The Secretary of the Department of Homeland Security (DHS), Kristi Noem, announced on Wednesday the termination of the 2021Temporary Protected Status (TPS) designation for Venezuelans, which will expire on Sept. 10, 2025. DHS announced that the termination will be effective 60 days after the publication of the Federal Register notice. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
